---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Find Trusted Senior Care in the Coal Region"
description: "Find trusted assisted living, home health, hospice, nursing homes, and senior support services in Schuylkill County, PA. A free community directory for Coal Region families."
---

<div class="container">
  <h1>Find Trusted Senior Care in the Coal Region</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">
    Assisted living, home health, hospice, and support services for Schuylkill County families. Finding care for a loved one is one of the hardest decisions a family makes. We built this directory to make it easier.
  </p>

  {% include "components/featured-listings.njk" %}

  <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);">
    {% for cat in businesses.categories %}
      <a href="/{{ cat.slug }}/" class="category-card">
        <span class="count">{{ cat.items.length }}</span>
        <span class="label">{{ cat.label }}</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Browse by City</h2>
    <div class="city-links">
      {% for city in businesses.cities %}
        {% if city.items.length >= 2 %}
          <a href="#city-{{ city.slug }}">{{ city.name }} ({{ city.items.length }})</a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Caring for a Loved One?</h2>
    <p class="page-intro">
      Whether you're exploring options for an aging parent, looking for home health support, or navigating a hospice decision, our guides can help you understand your choices.
    </p>
    <div class="city-links">
      <a href="/guides/assisted-living-vs-nursing-home-whats-the-difference/">Assisted Living vs. Nursing Home</a>
      <a href="/guides/how-to-choose-home-health-agency-pa/">Choosing a Home Health Agency</a>
      <a href="/guides/when-is-it-time-for-hospice/">When Is It Time for Hospice?</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebSite",
  "name": "{{ site.title }}",
  "url": "{{ site.url }}",
  "description": "{{ site.description }}"
}
</script>
